WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:10.564
Berry held his airplane close.

2
00:00:10.565 --> 00:00:13.442
"I don't know, Cupcake . . ."

3
00:00:13.443 --> 00:00:20.455
He looked at her crushed airplane.

4
00:00:20.456 --> 00:00:30.196
Cupcake shrugged. "Mine didn't work.

5
00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:33.993
I won't crush yours.

6
00:00:33.994 --> 00:00:37.217
You're my friend!"

7
00:00:37.218 --> 00:00:44.757
Berry sighed. "Okay."

8
00:00:44.758 --> 00:00:53.264
"Yay!" Cupcake grabbed his airplane. "Thanks!"

9
00:00:53.265 --> 00:00:57.745
"Be careful," Bok Choy said.

10
00:00:57.746 --> 00:01:14.427
"Okay!" Cupcake threw the airplane.

11
00:01:14.428 --> 00:01:18.592
"Woo-hoo!" She threw it again.

12
00:01:18.593 --> 00:01:26.129
It landed near the counter's edge!

13
00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:35.328
Berry gulped. "Be careful!"

14
00:01:35.329 --> 00:01:48.053
"This is fun!" Cupcake threw the airplane again.

15
00:01:48.054 --> 00:01:55.995
It went over the wet sink.

16
00:01:55.996 --> 00:02:07.619
Berry frowned. "That's enough!

17
00:02:07.620 --> 00:02:11.936
It's my turn now!"

18
00:02:11.937 --> 00:02:15.944
"Not yet," Cupcake said.

19
00:02:15.945 --> 00:02:20.923
"I want two more turns!"

20
00:02:20.924 --> 00:02:28.951
"You had enough turns!" Berry said.

21
00:02:28.952 --> 00:02:36.515
"One more throw!" Cupcake threw the airplane again.

22
00:02:36.516 --> 00:02:42.968
It went in the sink!

23
00:02:42.969 --> 00:02:50.111
They jumped in to get it.

24
00:02:50.112 --> 00:03:05.898
Berry gasped. "My airplane is all wet!"

